The FDS315 Fall Detection Sensor can detect if a person falls, so you can know the risk in time. It can be tremendously beneficial in nursing homes to monitor and link with other devices to make your home smarter.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- Fall detection (works on single person)
- Identifies the location of human activity
- Out-of-bed detection
- Real-time breathing rate detection during sleep
- Extends the range and strengthens ZigBee network communication
- Suitable for residential and commercial applications
